と親しくなる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"静也の励ましで、海外の病院で手術を受けることを決意。その際に静也に好意を伝え、「大人になったら結婚しよう」と約束。祖父からもらった懐中時計の巻き鍵を約束の証として静也に渡す。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17146","sourceWorkId":"25611","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"クールで凜とした雰囲気の少女。 名家・千鳥家の令嬢であり次期当主。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"お人好しの両親に代わって、千鳥家が関わる事業の交渉役に立っている才媛。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"財界からはその天才的かつ厳しい投資手腕から “氷の令嬢” と呼ばれている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ただしそれはビジネスのためで、静也と二人きりの時は年頃の女の子らしく振舞う。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"生まれつき病弱で、幼少期のほとんどがベッドで寝たきりの生活をしていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"7年ほど前、病状が悪化して入院した頃に静也と出会い親しくなった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「あまり堅苦しくしなくていいわよ。 いつも気を張ってたら、息が詰まるでしょ？」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"56311"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"83 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17146","sourceWorkId":"25611","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"c","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17146","sourceWorkId":"25611","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"150 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17146","sourceWorkId":"25611","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"82 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17146","sourceWorkId":"25611","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"52 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17146","sourceWorkId":"25611","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"体重（本版本）","value":"41 kg","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17146","sourceWorkId":"25611","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/08/08710c82b8ecb58605cfab72a9f4bff621430f3445ac2cc2270811026ca6fcef.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fd/fd96939cb35cca3e51e413634814c3353cea07eb856b83fa545e21c8a